0:58.320">think </span><span begin="00:58.320" end="00:58.620">you</span><span begin="00:58.620" end="00:58.650">’</span><span begin="00:58.650" end="00:58.710">re </span><span begin="00:58.710" end="00:59.670">alright</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.700" end="01:03.660"><span begin="00:59.700" end="00:59.940">But </span><span begin="00:59.940" end="01:00.090">you</span><span begin="01:00.090" end="01:00.120">’</span><span begin="01:00.120" end="01:00.480">re </span><span begin="01:00.480" end="01:01.110">acting </span><span begin="01:01.110" end="01:01.710">like </span><span begin="01:01.710" end="01:01.830">the </span><span begin="01:01.830" end="01:02.400">chick </span><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.670">all </span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:03.060">the </span><span begin="01:03.060" end="01:03.660">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.690" end="01:07.590"><span begin="01:03.690" end="01:03.960">You </span><span begin="01:03.960" end="01:04.080">are </span><span begin="01:04.080" end="01:04.710">cool </span><span begin="01:04.710" end="01:05.100">and </span><span begin="01:05.100" end="01:05.580">now </span><span begin="01:05.580" end="01:05.640">you</span><span begin="01:05.640" end="01:05.820">’</span><span begin="01:05.820" end="01:05.880">re </span><span begin="01:05.880" end="01:06.330">not </span><span begin="01:06.330" end="01:06.660">just </span><span begin="01:06.660" end="01:07.080">like </span><span begin="01:07.080" end="01:07.590">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.590" end="01:09.630"><span begin="01:07.590" end="01:07.920">When </span><span begin="01:07.920" end="01:08.100">you </span><span begin="01:08.100" end="01:08.820">grow </span><span begin="01:08.820" end="01:08.880">a </span><span begin="01:08.880" end="01:09.630">pear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.660" end="01:11.700"><span begin="01:09.660" end="01:09.900">You </span><span begin="01:09.900" end="01:10.140">can </span><span begin="01:10.140" end="01:10.620">call </span><span begin="01:10.620" end="01:10.890">me </span><span begin="01:10.890" end="01:11.700">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.970" end="01:13.260"><span begin="01:11.970" end="01:12.300">When </span><span begin="01:12.300" end="01:12.360">I </span><span begin="01:12.360" end="01:12.660">first </span><span begin="01:12.660" end="01:12.900">met </span><span begin="01:12.900" end="01:13.260">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.260" end="01:14.190"><span begin="01:13.260" end="01:13.620">Panties </span><span begin="01:13.620" end="01:14.190">droppin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.190" end="01:16.170"><span begin="01:14.190" end="01:14.370">Every </span><span begin="01:14.370" end="01:14.550">time </span><span begin="01:14.550" end="01:14.640">I </span><span begin="01:14.640" end="01:14.880">saw </span><span begin="01:14.880" end="01:15.210">you </span><span begin="01:15.210" end="01:15.360">it </span><span begin="01:15.360" end="01:15.750">was </span><span begin="01:15.750" end="01:15.960">on </span><span begin="01:15.960" end="01:16.170">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.170" end="01:18.150"><span begin="01:16.170" end="01:16.410">One </span><span begin="01:16.410" end="01:16.530">day </span><span begin="01:16.530" end="01:16.710">you </span><span begin="01:16.710" end="01:16.980">asked </span><span begin="01:16.980" end="01:17.130">if </span><span begin="01:17.130" end="01:17.280">we </span><span begin="01:17.280" end="01:17.400">can </span><span begin="01:17.400" end="01:17.670">just </span><span begin="01:17.670" end="01:18.150">talkin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.150" end="01:20.220"><span begin="01:18.150" end="01:18.330">That</span><span begin="01:18.330" end="01:18.360">’</span><span begin="01:18.360" end="01:18.420">s </span><span begin="01:18.420" end="01:18.630">the </span><span begin="01:18.630" end="01:19.110">reason </span><span begin="01:19.110" end="01:19.350">why </span><